<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Every word the admin panel draws.

  The `ad_` prefix follows the same rule as `bl_` in :webApp and `sl_` in
  :feature:servicelog. English throughout: this is an internal tool for a team
  that reads English, and nothing here is ever seen by an owner of the app.

  Copy rule for this file specifically: an error should say what to do next. The
  people reading these messages can fix most of what goes wrong, and "something
  went wrong" wastes the one chance to tell them which thing.
-->
